WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.777
Sumo Brawl puts everyone on a floating platform, over lava. Two to eight players, and it ends in shoving.

2
00:00:08.477 --> 00:00:15.277
Move with the arrow keys or WASD, or press and hold on the arena and your fighter walks toward your finger.

3
00:00:15.427 --> 00:00:19.798
Hit the dash button for a big shove. Then you need a moment to recharge.

4
00:00:20.498 --> 00:00:25.024
After ten seconds, the platform starts to shrink. Fall off, and you're out.

5
00:00:25.174 --> 00:00:27.744
Win the most rounds to be crowned the champion.
